      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. could u expand on the section about banking? i want to make sure the guide is really solid on the part about how current banking practices still carry those old legacies forward. like, what are the specific ways the system is still rigged to favor certain groups over others today? i want to give the students a clear, factual breakdown of the ongoing systemic issues.",
