      "content": "that makes a lot of sense. to balance it out a bit, i also want to make sure i can address any pushback from parents or students who might argue that these outcomes are more about individual financial decisions or economic factors rather than the systemic stuff we've talked about. what's the best way to frame those arguments in the guide so it doesn't look like we're ignoring them?",
